<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts ITT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential cuts ITT.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it downgraded ITT Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 16-1/8 to 58-3/4 after ITT late Monday received a hostile takeover bid from Hilton Hotels Corp.</p>
</text>
